  message: "Merged PR #3125 (commit 761a84119) on 2026-04-17. Adds backtick template-literal scanning for fetch() and axios.METHOD() + module-scope string-const folding + prefix-match fallback for variable URLs in link_http. Closes the motivating case from WI-tinip (alertmanager mantine-ui api.ts fetch with ${pathPrefix}/${API_PATH}${path}${queryString}). Full suite at 100% coverage. Elm let-bound / String.join URL idioms remain tracked separately in WI-rosan."  # 3da2
